       "explicacion": "Every subordinating conjunction such as «dass» sends the conjugated verb to the end of the clause.",
       "correcta": true
      },
      {
       "texto": "In second syntactic position, immediately after the subject.",
       "lengua": "alumno",
       "explicacion": "That position corresponds to sentences without the conjunction «dass».",
       "correcta": false
      },
      {
       "texto": "In absolute first position, before the subject and the complements.",
